# The search's Tags and Works filters on the release's sample data: the
# network cards, then those tagged retro (chosen from the tag pick
# list), those of them that work, and those not known to be broken;
# then each filter alone, without a text or category: every item tagged
# retro, then every broken item.
#@ SAMPLE
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T admin
K ENTER
T admin
K TAB
T Sample1986
K TAB
T Sample1986
K CTRL-S ENTER
K CTRL-F
T network
K TAB TAB
T CARD
K CTRL-S
S CARDS
K ESC PGDN UP F4
S TAGPICK
T rrr
K ENTER CTRL-S
S RETRO
K ESC PGDN SPACE SPACE
S WORKSY
K CTRL-S
S WORKING
K ESC SPACE SPACE SPACE CTRL-S
S NOTBROKE
K ESC SPACE PGUP CTRL-Y TAB TAB CTRL-Y CTRL-S
S TAGONLY
K ESC PGDN UP CTRL-Y DOWN SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE CTRL-S
S BROKEN
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
